WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.039 --> 00:00:08.184
Tor flew over the mountain.

2
00:00:08.185 --> 00:00:13.249
"Rex! Where are you?"

3
00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:16.522
Tor found Sara and Sid.

4
00:00:16.523 --> 00:00:19.714
"Did you find Rex?" Sara asked.

5
00:00:19.715 --> 00:00:22.622
"No," Tor said.

6
00:00:22.623 --> 00:00:29.058
A rodent ran over.

7
00:00:29.059 --> 00:00:32.782
"Are you looking for Rex?" he asked.

8
00:00:32.783 --> 00:00:35.725
"Yes!" Sid said.

9
00:00:35.726 --> 00:00:38.933
"Do you know where he is?"

10
00:00:38.934 --> 00:00:48.486
Mike nodded. "Follow me!"

11
00:00:48.487 --> 00:00:52.378
Rocks fell on Rex and Annie.

12
00:00:52.379 --> 00:00:58.459
"We can't stay in here," Rex said.

13
00:00:58.460 --> 00:01:01.863
Rex and Annie tried pushing again.

14
00:01:01.864 --> 00:01:07.695
"Grr!" they said.

15
00:01:07.696 --> 00:01:12.394
Annie gasped. "The rock moved!"

16
00:01:12.395 --> 00:01:14.622
Rex looked down.

17
00:01:14.623 --> 00:01:17.463
He saw a spike.

18
00:01:17.464 --> 00:01:20.389
"Sid!" Rex cried.

19
00:01:20.390 --> 00:01:23.441
"I'll pull!" Sid said.

20
00:01:23.442 --> 00:01:38.321
"Keep pushing!"

21
00:01:38.322 --> 00:01:42.213
At last Rex and Annie got out.

22
00:01:42.214 --> 00:01:48.258
The cave crashed down. Boom!

23
00:01:48.259 --> 00:01:52.189
"Whew!" everyone said.

24
00:01:52.190 --> 00:01:56.721
Annie smiled at Sid. "Thanks!"

25
00:01:56.722 --> 00:01:59.065
"Mike," Rex said.

26
00:01:59.066 --> 00:02:06.575
Mike gulped. "Yes?"

27
00:02:06.576 --> 00:02:21.343
Rex grinned. "You're a hero!"

